This fork's modifications (packaging, dependency and environment updates,
dead-code removal, and other changes made in this repository on top of the
original code) are licensed under the MIT License below.

The underlying SPARC model code, architecture, and checkpoints originate from
the official codebase by Cheol Jun Cho, Peter Wu, Tejas S. Prabhune, Dhruv
Agarwal, and Gopala K. Anumanchipalli (Berkeley Speech Group), released
without an explicit license. Modifications to that code are made here with
the original authors' permission. If you use this software, please cite the
original paper:

Cheol Jun Cho, Peter Wu, Tejas S. Prabhune, Dhruv Agarwal, and Gopala K.
Anumanchipalli, "Coding Speech through Vocal Tract Kinematics," IEEE Journal
of Selected Topics in Signal Processing, vol. 18, no. 8, pp. 1427-1440, 2024.
https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.12998

